flowchart LR
    U[User / API Client] --> R[Requirement Input]
    R --> W[Agentic Workflow Orchestrator]
    W --> A[Requirement Analysis]
    A --> D[Task Decomposition]
    D --> I[Implementation]
    I --> T[Testing]
    T --> Doc[Documentation]
    Doc --> G[Release Readiness Gate]
    G --> H[Human Approval]
    H --> REL[Release Ready]

    U --> C[POST /api/links]
    C --> SC[ShortUrlController]
    SC --> SS[ShortUrlService]
    SS --> DS[(In-memory Link Store)]
    SS --> ST[Analytics and Click Tracking]
    ST --> RED[GET /code redirect]
    RED --> URL[Original Target URL]

    SS --> API[API Response]
    W --> MET[Workflow Metrics]
    MET --> OBS[Audit Trail and Traceability]
